         /O2と両立しない/RTC、Edit and ContinueをこのKernelだけ外し、PDBと浮動小数点精度は維持します。 -->
    <ClCompile Update="Raven\Physics\SoftBody\SoftBodySolver.cpp;Raven\Physics\SoftBody\SoftBodyIntegratedStep.cpp;Raven\Physics\SoftBody\SoftBodyTriangleSpatialHashGrid.cpp;Raven\Physics\SoftBody\SoftBodySpatialHashGrid.cpp;Raven\Physics\Particle\ParticleSpatialHashGrid.cpp;Raven\Physics\Fluid\SPHSolver.cpp;Raven\Physics\Fluid\FluidSpatialHashGrid.cpp;Raven\Physics\Fluid\Debug\FluidSPHDemoLayer.cpp;Raven\Physics\Coupling\FluidColliderContact.cpp;Raven\Physics\Coupling\FluidStaticColliderCoupling.cpp;Raven\Physics\Coupling\FluidRigidBodyCoupling.cpp;Raven\Physics\Solver\ContactSolver.cpp">
